## Mechs

uplink-mech-teleporter-ussp-name = heavy USSP mech
uplink-mech-teleporter-ussp-desc = A fully equipped heavy USSP combat mech supplied with a repair kit. Slow, well protected, and armed for breaking fortified positions.
uplink-mech-teleporter-ussp-medium-name = medium USSP mech
uplink-mech-teleporter-ussp-medium-desc = A fully equipped medium USSP combat mech supplied with a repair kit. More mobile than the heavy model and intended for fighting infantry.
